{
 "slug": "home",
 "es_slug": "inicio",
 "main": "<main id=\"main\">\n\n<!-- ====================================================================\n     HERO\n==================================================================== -->\n<section class=\"hero\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"hero-panel\">\n\n<!-- Backlight for the WHOLE hero. FOUR INDEPENDENT LAYERS, each its own\n     element so it can be nudged on its own. Every position lives in\n     css/hero.css under BACKLIGHT, as custom properties on the element:\n       --x  horizontal centre, % of the panel\n       --y  vertical centre,   % of the panel\n       --w  width,             % of the panel (height follows the artwork)\n       --o  opacity\n     Moving one glow means changing one line.\n\n     This sits FIRST in the panel and carries no z-index of its own, so the\n     glows paint behind the copy column (z-index:1) and behind the dashboard\n     stage by DOM order -- while still being individually raisable via the\n     editor's Depth control. See the note in css/hero.css. -->\n<div class=\"hero-glows\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n  <img class=\"dg dg-1\" src=\"assets/img/glow-1-left-blue.webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\">\n  <img class=\"dg dg-2\" src=\"assets/img/glow-2-top-magenta.webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\">\n  <img class=\"dg dg-3\" src=\"assets/img/glow-3-right-violet.webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\">\n  <img class=\"dg dg-4\" src=\"assets/img/glow-4-bottomright-purple.webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\">\n  <img class=\"dg dg-1 dup-1\" src=\"assets/img/glow-1-left-blue.webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\">\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"hero-light\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n\n\n\n\n\n<!-- ====================================================================\n     CURVAS DE BRILLO DEL HERO — ancladas al LAYOUT, no a un viewBox fijo.\n\n     POR QU&Eacute; CAMBI&Oacute; ESTO (2026-07-30): antes viv&iacute;an en un solo\n     <svg viewBox=\"0 0 1300 760\" preserveAspectRatio=\"slice\"> del ancho del panel. slice escala\n     por max(W/1300, H/760) — y CU&Aacute;L de esos dos t&eacute;rminos gana se invierte cuando\n     cambia la relaci&oacute;n de aspecto del panel. Al invertirse, el recorte cambia de eje y\n     todas las curvas saltan. Mientras tanto, el dashboard lo coloca la cuadr&iacute;cula CSS\n     en p&iacute;xeles reales, as&iacute; que los dos nunca se siguieron y se separaban en\n     cada ancho de viewport. Por eso las l&iacute;neas &laquo;se mov&iacute;an por todas partes&raquo;.\n\n     Ahora cada curva es un <img> simple posicionado en PORCENTAJES de la caja a la\n     que pertenece, as&iacute; que escala con esa caja y con nada m&aacute;s:\n       .hero-fx   — abarca el panel. Contiene las curvas 2 y 4, fijadas al\n                    borde izquierdo y a la esquina inferior derecha del panel.\n       .stage-fx  — abarca la columna del dashboard. Contiene las curvas 1 y 3, que\n                    pertenecen a la losa y deben quedarse fijas respecto a ella.\n     Los porcentajes se convirtieron de los n&uacute;meros del viewBox anterior al ancho\n     de dise&ntilde;o; los valores est&aacute;n en css/hero.css. -->\n<div class=\"hero-grid\">\n\n  <div class=\"hero-copy\" data-reveal>\n\n    <h1>Dirige tu negocio de Amazon con <span class=\"grad-text\">confianza.</span></h1>\n\n    <p class=\"hero-sub\">Todo conectado. Todo sincronizado.<br>Toma mejores decisiones, m&aacute;s r&aacute;pido.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"hero-cta\">\n      <a class=\"btn btn--primary btn--lg\" href=\"#waitlist\" data-waitlist-open data-source=\"hero\" data-magnetic>\n        &Uacute;nete a la lista de espera <svg class=\"icon-sm\"><use href=\"#i-arrow\"/></svg>\n      </a>\n    </div>\n\n    <ul class=\"ticks\">\n      <li><svg class=\"icon-sm\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg>Acceso anticipado</li>\n      <li><svg class=\"icon-sm\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg>Importa en minutos</li>\n      <li><svg class=\"icon-sm\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg>Sin compromiso</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <div class=\"hero-floats\">\n\n      <div class=\"float-card f1\">\n        <div class=\"float-top\">\n          <span class=\"float-label\">Precisi&oacute;n del pron&oacute;stico</span>\n          <span class=\"float-delta\"><svg class=\"icon-sm\" style=\"width:10px;height:10px\"><use href=\"#i-trend\"/></svg>8&nbsp;%</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"float-value\">94&nbsp;%</div>\n        <svg class=\"float-spark\" viewBox=\"0 0 140 40\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n          <path fill=\"url(#sparkFillGreen)\" d=\"@@T16@@\"/>\n          <path class=\"spark-line\" stroke=\"#2ED47A\" d=\"@@T17@@\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"float-card f2\">\n        <div class=\"float-top\">\n          <span class=\"float-label\">ROAS</span>\n          <span class=\"float-delta\"><svg class=\"icon-sm\" style=\"width:10px;height:10px\"><use href=\"#i-trend\"/></svg>14&nbsp;%</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"float-value\">5.9x</div>\n        <svg class=\"float-spark\" viewBox=\"0 0 140 40\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n          <path fill=\"url(#sparkFillBlue)\" d=\"@@T18@@\"/>\n          <path class=\"spark-line\" stroke=\"#7EB3FF\" d=\"@@T19@@\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"float-card f3\">\n        <div class=\"float-top\">\n          <span class=\"float-label\">Utilidad</span>\n          <span class=\"float-delta\"><svg class=\"icon-sm\" style=\"width:10px;height:10px\"><use href=\"#i-trend\"/></svg>18&nbsp;%</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"float-value\">+$18,240</div>\n        <svg class=\"float-spark\" viewBox=\"0 0 140 40\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n          <path fill=\"url(#sparkFillPurple)\" d=\"@@T20@@\"/>\n          <path class=\"spark-line\" stroke=\"#A971F7\" d=\"@@T21@@\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"float-card f4\">\n        <div class=\"float-top\">\n          <span class=\"float-label\">Inventario</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"float-inv\">\n          <span class=\"float-check\"><svg><use href=\"#i-shield\"/></svg></span>\n          <span class=\"float-value\" style=\"margin-top:0\">Seguro<small>42 d&iacute;as</small></span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ============================ DASHBOARD ============================ -->\n  <div class=\"hero-stage\" data-reveal>\n  <div class=\"hero-stage-inner\">\n\n  <!-- The dashboard is now the rendered artwork, cropped out of\n       Images/Dashboard.png. That source is a full UI-kit sheet — the card\n       itself occupies x 11..1103, y 54..827 of the 1536x1024 original, with a\n       colour-palette column to its right and a notes strip below; those are\n       cropped away in assets/img/dashboard.jpg (1097x778).\n\n       It is positioned ABSOLUTELY over .dash rather than replacing it. .dash\n       stays in the DOM (visibility:hidden, see css/dashboard.css) and keeps\n       defining the hero panel's height. That matters: every hero curve is\n       placed in viewBox units derived from the panel's dimensions, so letting\n       the image resize the panel would shift all four of them.\n\n       The 3D transform mirrors .dash exactly, so the slab tilts the same way\n       and reacts to hover the same way. -->\n  <!-- Backlight behind the dashboard. THREE INDEPENDENT LAYERS, each its own\n       element so it can be nudged on its own. Every position lives in\n       css/hero.css under BACKLIGHT, as custom properties on the element:\n         --x  horizontal centre, % of the stage\n         --y  vertical centre,   % of the stage\n         --w  width,             % of the stage (height follows the artwork)\n         --o  opacity\n       Moving one glow means changing one line. The defaults reproduce the\n       composition the four source files were drawn in. -->\n  <img class=\"dash-shot\" src=\"assets/img/dashboard.jpg\"\n       alt=\"Panel de AmazeBase con ingresos, utilidad, flujo de caja e inventario\"\n       width=\"1097\" height=\"778\" decoding=\"async\">\n\n  <div class=\"dash\" data-tilt>\n  <div class=\"dash-edge-b\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n  <div class=\"dash-edge-r\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n  <div class=\"dash-face\">\n\n    <div class=\"dash-bar\">\n      <span class=\"dash-brand\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <path d=\"M16 3.2 29 27.5h-6.4L16 14.1 9.4 27.5H3z\" fill=\"url(#markGrad)\"/>\n        </svg>\n        <span data-brand>AmazeBase</span>\n      </span>\n      <div class=\"dash-bar-right\">\n        <span class=\"dash-chip\"><svg><use href=\"#i-calendar\"/></svg>Este mes</span>\n        <span class=\"dash-chip\"><svg><use href=\"#i-refresh\"/></svg>vs. mes anterior</span>\n        <span class=\"dash-chip\"><svg><use href=\"#i-export\"/></svg>Exportar</span>\n        <span class=\"dash-avatar\">MJ</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"dash-body\">\n\n      <aside class=\"dash-side\">\n        <span class=\"dash-nav is-active\"><svg><use href=\"#i-grid\"/></svg>Resumen</span>\n        <span class=\"dash-nav\"><svg><use href=\"#i-box\"/></svg>Productos</span>\n        <span class=\"dash-nav\"><svg><use href=\"#i-search\"/></svg>Investigaci&oacute;n</span>\n        <span class=\"dash-nav\"><svg><use href=\"#i-mega\"/></svg>Publicidad</span>\n        <span class=\"dash-nav\"><svg><use href=\"#i-stack\"/></svg>Inventario</span>\n        <span class=\"dash-nav\"><svg><use href=\"#i-calendar\"/></svg>Pron&oacute;sticos</span>\n        <span class=\"dash-nav\"><svg><use href=\"#i-dollar\"/></svg>Finanzas</span>\n        <span class=\"dash-nav\"><svg><use href=\"#i-truck\"/></svg>Proveedores</span>\n        <span class=\"dash-nav\"><svg><use href=\"#i-report\"/></svg>Reportes</span>\n        <span class=\"dash-nav\"><svg><use href=\"#i-spark\"/></svg>Asistente de IA</span>\n        <span class=\"dash-nav\"><svg><use href=\"#i-bell\"/></svg>Alertas</span>\n        <span class=\"dash-nav\"><svg><use href=\"#i-gear\"/></svg>Configuraci&oacute;n</span>\n      </aside>\n\n      <div class=\"dash-main\">\n\n        <div class=\"dash-kpis\">\n          <div class=\"kpi\">\n            <div class=\"kpi-label\">Ingresos totales</div>\n            <div class=\"kpi-value\">$184,209</div>\n            <div class=\"kpi-foot\">\n              <span class=\"kpi-delta\">↑ 28.6&nbsp;%</span>\n              <svg class=\"kpi-spark\" viewBox=\"0 0 52 18\"><path d=\"@@T22@@\"/></svg>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"kpi\">\n            <div class=\"kpi-label\">Utilidad neta</div>\n            <div class=\"kpi-value\">$47,263</div>\n            <div class=\"kpi-foot\">\n              <span class=\"kpi-delta\">↑ 18.7&nbsp;%</span>\n              <svg class=\"kpi-spark\" viewBox=\"0 0 52 18\"><path d=\"@@T23@@\"/></svg>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"kpi\">\n            <div class=\"kpi-label\">Flujo de caja</div>\n            <div class=\"kpi-value\">$23,156</div>\n            <div class=\"kpi-foot\">\n              <span class=\"kpi-delta\">↑ 21.3&nbsp;%</span>\n              <svg class=\"kpi-spark\" viewBox=\"0 0 52 18\"><path d=\"@@T24@@\"/></svg>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"kpi\">\n            <div class=\"kpi-label\">Valor del inventario</div>\n            <div class=\"kpi-value\">$96,147</div>\n            <div class=\"kpi-foot\">\n              <span class=\"kpi-delta\">↑ 16.4&nbsp;%</span>\n              <svg class=\"kpi-spark\" viewBox=\"0 0 52 18\"><path d=\"@@T25@@\"/></svg>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- profit chart -->\n        <div class=\"panel\">\n          <div class=\"panel-head\">\n            <span class=\"panel-title\">Resumen de utilidad</span>\n            <span class=\"panel-link\">&Uacute;ltimos 30 d&iacute;as</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"chart-value\">\n            <b>$47,263</b><span>↑ 18.7&nbsp;%</span><em>vs. mes anterior</em>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"chart-legend\">\n            <span><i style=\"background:#3B82F6\"></i>Ingresos</span>\n            <span><i style=\"background:#8B3BF1\"></i>Utilidad</span>\n          </div>\n          <svg class=\"chart\" viewBox=\"0 0 460 150\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Tendencia de ingresos y utilidad de los &uacute;ltimos 30 d&iacute;as\">\n            <line class=\"grid-line\" x1=\"30\" y1=\"14\"  x2=\"450\" y2=\"14\"/>\n            <line class=\"grid-line\" x1=\"30\" y1=\"42\"  x2=\"450\" y2=\"42\"/>\n            <line class=\"grid-line\" x1=\"30\" y1=\"70\"  x2=\"450\" y2=\"70\"/>\n            <line class=\"grid-line\" x1=\"30\" y1=\"98\"  x2=\"450\" y2=\"98\"/>\n            <line class=\"grid-line\" x1=\"30\" y1=\"126\" x2=\"450\" y2=\"126\"/>\n            <text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"4\" y=\"17\">$80K</text>\n            <text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"4\" y=\"45\">$60K</text>\n            <text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"4\" y=\"73\">$40K</text>\n            <text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"4\" y=\"101\">$20K</text>\n            <text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"12\" y=\"129\">$0</text>\n            <path class=\"area-a\" d=\"@@T26@@\"/>\n            <path class=\"area-b\" d=\"@@T27@@\"/>\n            <path class=\"series-a\" d=\"@@T28@@\"/>\n            <path class=\"series-b\" d=\"@@T29@@\"/>\n            <text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"30\"  y=\"142\">1 may</text>\n            <text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"130\" y=\"142\">8 may</text>\n            <text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"235\" y=\"142\">15 may</text>\n            <text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"340\" y=\"142\">22 may</text>\n            <text class=\"axis-text\" x=\"424\" y=\"142\">29 may</text>\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- right column -->\n        <div style=\"display:grid;gap:8px;align-content:start;min-width:0\">\n\n          <div class=\"panel\">\n            <div class=\"panel-head\"><span class=\"panel-title\">Salud del inventario</span></div>\n            <div class=\"donut-wrap\">\n              <div class=\"donut-meta\">\n                <b>42</b>\n                <span>d&iacute;as de stock</span>\n                <span class=\"status\"><i class=\"dot dot--green\"></i>Saludable</span>\n              </div>\n              <svg class=\"donut\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"42 d&iacute;as de stock, saludable\">\n                <circle class=\"track\" cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"40\"/>\n                <circle class=\"value\" cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"40\" stroke-dasharray=\"176 251\"/>\n              </svg>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"panel\">\n            <div class=\"panel-head\">\n              <span class=\"panel-title\">Alertas</span>\n              <span class=\"panel-link\">Ver todo</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"alerts\">\n              <div class=\"alert\">\n                <span class=\"alert-ico is-red\"><svg><use href=\"#i-warn\"/></svg></span>\n                <div><b>Riesgo de inventario</b><span>3 productos por debajo de 14 d&iacute;as</span></div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"alert\">\n                <span class=\"alert-ico is-amber\"><svg><use href=\"#i-dollar\"/></svg></span>\n                <div><b>Pago a proveedor</b><span>$12,500 vence en 7 d&iacute;as</span></div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"alert\">\n                <span class=\"alert-ico is-green\"><svg><use href=\"#i-trend\"/></svg></span>\n                <div><b>Oportunidad de campa&ntilde;a</b><span>Aumenta el presupuesto en 6 palabras clave</span></div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"alert\">\n                <span class=\"alert-ico is-blue\"><svg><use href=\"#i-box\"/></svg></span>\n                <div><b>Reposici&oacute;n recomendada</b><span>8 productos por reponer</span></div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- top products -->\n        <div class=\"panel dash-table-wrap\">\n          <div class=\"panel-head\">\n            <span class=\"panel-title\">Productos principales</span>\n            <span class=\"panel-link\">Ver todo</span>\n          </div>\n          <table class=\"dash-table\">\n            <thead>\n              <tr>\n                <th>Producto</th><th>Ingresos</th><th>Utilidad</th><th>Margen</th>\n                <th>Inventario</th><th>Pron&oacute;stico</th><th>Estado</th>\n              </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n              <tr>\n                <td><span class=\"prod\"><i></i>Molinillo de Caf&eacute; Port&aacute;til</span></td>\n                <td>$23,590</td><td>$8,612</td><td>30.1&nbsp;%</td><td>486</td><td>42 d&iacute;as</td>\n                <td><span class=\"tag tag--green\"><i class=\"dot dot--green\"></i>Saludable</span></td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td><span class=\"prod\"><i></i>Prensa Francesa de Acero Inoxidable</span></td>\n                <td>$24,680</td><td>$7,415</td><td>30.0&nbsp;%</td><td>352</td><td>35 d&iacute;as</td>\n                <td><span class=\"tag tag--green\"><i class=\"dot dot--green\"></i>Saludable</span></td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td><span class=\"prod\"><i></i>Moldes de Silicona para Freidora de Aire</span></td>\n                <td>$19,230</td><td>$6,192</td><td>32.2&nbsp;%</td><td>215</td><td>28 d&iacute;as</td>\n                <td><span class=\"tag tag--amber\"><i class=\"dot dot--amber\"></i>Stock bajo</span></td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td><span class=\"prod\"><i></i>B&aacute;scula Digital de Cocina</span></td>\n                <td>$15,340</td><td>$4,910</td><td>32.0&nbsp;%</td><td>120</td><td>16 d&iacute;as</td>\n                <td><span class=\"tag tag--amber\"><i class=\"dot dot--amber\"></i>Stock bajo</span></td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td><span class=\"prod\"><i></i>Espumador de Leche de Mano</span></td>\n                <td>$12,550</td><td>$3,735</td><td>29.1&nbsp;%</td><td>74</td><td>12 d&iacute;as</td>\n                <td><span class=\"tag tag--red\"><i class=\"dot dot--red\"></i>En riesgo</span></td>\n              </tr>\n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  </div>\n  </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ====================================================================\n     PIPELINE\n==================================================================== -->\n<!-- =====================================================================\n     AMAZEBASE — secci&oacute;n pipeline &laquo;Un solo espacio. Cada decisi&oacute;n.&raquo;.\n     AUTOCONTENIDA. Pega este bloque entero en lugar de la\n     <section class=\"pipeline\">...</section> existente y borra esa.\n\n     · Todo el CSS est&aacute; en l&iacute;nea y bajo el espacio de nombres .abp-* — no puede\n       chocar con ninguna hoja de estilos existente ni verse afectado por ella.\n     · Los 7 &iacute;conos est&aacute;n incrustados como data URIs. Sin archivos de imagen, sin rutas que arreglar.\n     · No depende de nada: ni variables CSS de tu tema, ni sprite, ni librer&iacute;a\n       JS. Usa Inter si est&aacute; presente; si no, la fuente del sistema.\n\n     PARA CAMBIAR EL TAMA&Ntilde;O: cambia las variables del bloque RESIZE de abajo. No hace\n     falta recalcular nada m&aacute;s — los huecos del marco se miden solos.\n===================================================================== -->\n<section class=\"abp\">\n<style>@@T2@@</style>\n\n  <div class=\"abp-wrap\">\n    <div class=\"abp-box\">\n      <span class=\"abp-frame\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i></span>\n      <h2 class=\"abp-title\">Un solo espacio. Cada decisi&oacute;n.</h2>\n\n      <div class=\"abp-rail\">\n        <span class=\"abp-seg\" style=\"left:9.293%;width:9.986%;background:#4E94F8!important\"></span>\n        <span class=\"abp-seg\" style=\"left:23.579%;width:9.986%;background:#669EF9!important\"></span>\n        <span class=\"abp-seg\" style=\"left:37.864%;width:9.986%;background:#7C7CF7!important\"></span>\n        <span class=\"abp-seg\" style=\"left:52.150%;width:9.986%;background:#9A57F7!important\"></span>\n        <span class=\"abp-seg\" style=\"left:66.436%;width:9.986%;background:#C451F3!important\"></span>\n        <span class=\"abp-seg\" style=\"left:80.721%;width:9.986%;background:#E0479A!important\"></span>\n        <span class=\"abp-dot\" style=\"left:14.286%;background:#3B82F6!important\"></span>\n        <span class=\"abp-dot\" style=\"left:28.571%;background:#60A5FA!important\"></span>\n        <span class=\"abp-dot\" style=\"left:42.857%;background:#8B5CF6!important\"></span>\n        <span class=\"abp-dot\" style=\"left:57.143%;background:#A855F7!important\"></span>\n        <span class=\"abp-dot\" style=\"left:71.429%;background:#D946EF!important\"></span>\n        <span class=\"abp-dot\" style=\"left:85.714%;background:#EC4899!important\"></span>\n\n        <div class=\"abp-node\"><img src=\"@@T4@@\" alt=\"\"><span>Investigaci&oacute;n</span></div>\n        <div class=\"abp-node\"><img src=\"@@T5@@\" alt=\"\"><span>Lanzamiento</span></div>\n        <div class=\"abp-node\"><img src=\"@@T6@@\" alt=\"\"><span>Inventario</span></div>\n        <div class=\"abp-node\"><img src=\"@@T7@@\" alt=\"\"><span>Proveedores</span></div>\n        <div class=\"abp-node\"><img src=\"@@T8@@\" alt=\"\"><span>Publicidad</span></div>\n        <div class=\"abp-node\"><img src=\"@@T9@@\" alt=\"\"><span>Flujo de caja</span></div>\n        <div class=\"abp-node\"><img src=\"@@T10@@\" alt=\"\"><span>Utilidad</span></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <p class=\"abp-caption\">Todos tus datos. Conectados. En tiempo real.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n<script>@@T1@@</script>\n</section>\n<!-- ================= end AmazeBase pipeline section ================= -->\n\n<!-- ====================================================================\n     COMPARE\n==================================================================== -->\n<!-- =====================================================================\n     AMAZEBASE — secci&oacute;n VS &laquo;Casi todos los vendedores hacen malabares con demasiadas herramientas.&raquo;.\n     AUTOCONTENIDA. Pega este bloque entero en lugar de la\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"compare\">...</section> existente y borra esa.\n\n     · El CSS est&aacute; en l&iacute;nea y bajo el espacio de nombres .abc-* — no puede chocar con tus hojas.\n     · Los logos est&aacute;n incrustados como data URIs. Sin archivos de imagen, sin rutas que arreglar.\n     · El diagrama de cada tarjeta es UN SOLO SVG, as&iacute; que las l&iacute;neas de conexi&oacute;n y aquello\n       a lo que apuntan comparten un &uacute;nico espacio de coordenadas. Las l&iacute;neas llegan a su\n       destino por construcci&oacute;n, no a base de ajustes. La versi&oacute;n anterior dibujaba las l&iacute;neas en un\n       viewBox de 400x260 con preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" mientras posicionaba los\n       chips por separado en porcentajes — dos sistemas de coordenadas que nunca se\n       conciliaron, y por eso nada conectaba.\n\n     PARA CAMBIAR EL TAMA&Ntilde;O: cambia las variables del bloque RESIZE. Nada m&aacute;s.\n===================================================================== -->\n<section class=\"abc\" id=\"compare\">\n<style>@@T3@@</style>\n\n  <div class=\"abc-wrap\">\n    <div class=\"abc-grid\">\n\n      <div class=\"abc-card abc-card--bad\">\n        <h3>Casi todos los vendedores hacen malabares con demasiadas herramientas.</h3>\n        <div class=\"abc-stage\">\n          <svg class=\"abc-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 560 210\" role=\"img\"\n               aria-label=\"Ocho herramientas desconectadas unidas por l&iacute;neas punteadas rotas\">\n      <path class=\"abc-dash\" d=\"M83,44 Q147,58 210,37\"/>\